            "review_title": "Review at Collins St",
            "review_text": "guydickson1987\nHue, Vietnam36 contributions\n0\nExcellent Matcha and Coffee\nApr 2014 • Friends\nWalked/Driven past this so many times but never stopped to go inside, what a mistake. This place is amazing. Drinks are excellent, had a coffee and the ice blended Matcha, and both were amazing and excellent value!. The place is very clean and comfortable and the staff are so friendly and welcoming. Service is very quick and efficient.\nValue\nService\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 28, 2014",
