            "review_title": "Review at Collins St",
            "review_text": "MicheleNorth\n14 contributions\n0\nLatte & Cappuccino Heaven\nFeb 2014 • Business\nI Couldn't have been happier to be introduced to this heavenly little coffee shop, just doors away from my accommodation at the Lancaster Hotel. Passionately owned and managed by a very nice guy who we call Collin! He brews his own blends of beans and has mastered the art of making a truly great cup of western/european coffee. From the moment you walk in and smell the aroma you know that you are in the right place. If your in the Ba Dinh area and are craving a cuppa this is the place to head for your Latte or Cappuccino..\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 13, 2014",
