            "review_title": "Review at Collins St",
            "review_text": "Robert H\nGlasgow, United Kingdom208 contributions\n0\nExcellent Western Coffee!\nFeb 2014 • Business\nCollins St. Coffee Shop is a little gem! Offering western style coffee that is almost impossible to find in this part of the city and at local prices. \n\nEspresso, cappuccino's al the Latte varieties, together with fluent English speaking staff, free WiFi and power outlets at every table. It's a tiny little shop but certainly not to be missed if your looking for great coffee.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 11, 2014",
